106 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 93 0 R/T(TRAGEDY AT LAKE NYOS)/E(TRAGEDY AT LAKE NYOS)/Pg 10 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

107 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 93 0 R/T(Over 1,700 Dead)/E(Over 1,700 Dead)/Pg 10 0 R/K[5]>>
