<</Title(Survivors reported that oil lamps extinguished on their own, even with fuel still inside. Livestock stumbled and fell, chickens stopped mid-cluck, and people collapsed suddenly, many unable to make it out of their homes. By dawn, entire villages were silent. Families were found sitting where they had gathered for evening meals, some still holding tools or cups. Bodies were discovered along trails and near cooking fires, suggesting people were)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 422 0 R/Prev 455 0 R>>
